<p>    Exports		 14.27 (-4.4)	   15.04  (6.7)</p>
<p>    Domestic exports     8.22 (-4.6)	    8.61  (7.4)</p>
<p>    Oil			1.21 (7.4)	     1.33 (13.9)</p>
<p>    Non-oil		  7.01 (-6.3)	    7.28  (6.3)</p>
<p>    Re-exports	     6.05 (-4.2)	    6.44  (5.8)</p>
<p>    Imports		 14.40 (-8.5)	   15.79  (1.6)</p>
